cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Capacity Cliff and Calibration Ablation in a Hybrid Quantum--Classical Classifier"
abstract: >-
  Source, code and verification artefacts for a controlled study of whether the quantum
  layer of a hybrid quantum--classical classifier contributes to accuracy and calibration.
  Includes a dephasing ablation that classicalises the quantum layer within a single model,
  a Lean 4 formalisation of the underlying commutation theorems, and a real-hardware
  protocol for Quantum Inspire (Tuna-17).
authors:
